# Khuon cua .env.opencode — file env RIENG cua container opencode-server.
#
# DANH SACH DONG: dung nhung bien liet o duoi, khong hon. Day la bat bien duoc
# kiem bang may (tests/test_env_contract.py) chu khong phai quy uoc.
#
# Vi sao khong dung chung .env: opencode-server chay agent co quyen `read`, no doc
# duoc /proc/self/environ. Neu do ca .env vao day thi agent co TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN
# (gia danh bot, vo hieu AC-02/AC-11) va OPENCODE_PG_PASSWORD (vao thang Postgres
# dung chung voi headscale) — luc do viec tach mang db_net mat gan het y nghia.
#
# Chu y: bat bien la "danh sach dong", KHONG phai "dung hai bien". Cai can chan la
# BI MAT CUA GATEWAY lot sang day; mot dia chi noi bo thi khong. Doc nham con so
# thanh cai luat da lam ta bo sot CLIPROXY_BASE_URL — xem chu thich cua no.
#
# Moi dong bien o duoi deu duoc theo sau bang mot dong chu thich hoac het file.
# Khong phai cho dep: bo quet bi mat truoc commit doc "TEN_BIEN=" rong roi vo lay
# ten bien o dong ke tiep lam "gia tri", nen hai dong bien lien nhau se bi bao
# nham. Chen chu thich vao giua la cach khong phai noi doi voi bo quet.

OPENCODE_SERVER_PASSWORD=

# Khong phai bi mat — day la dia chi noi bo tren mang `edge`; biet no ma khong co
# API key o duoi thi cung khong lam gi duoc.
#
# Bat buoc phai co MAT O DAY chu khong chi trong .env: opencode.json.template ghi
# "baseURL": "{env:CLIPROXY_BASE_URL}", va OpenCode giai gia tri {env:...} tu moi
# truong cua CHINH tien trinh server. Container opencode-server chi doc file nay,
# nen thieu bien -> baseURL rong -> moi loi goi model deu di vao hu khong.
#
# Do dung la chuyen da xay ra. Phep do API ngay 2026-08-18 thay `GET /config` tren
# container DANG CHAY tra ve "baseURL":"", trong khi phep thu khoi o buoc 5 cua
# deploy van xanh — vi no them mot doi so `-e` vao `docker run`, tuc la no chung
# minh mot cau hinh KHAC voi cau hinh that su chay. Da bo doi so do; gio phep thu
# khoi dung dung `--env-file .env.opencode`, khong hon.
CLIPROXY_BASE_URL=http://cliproxy:8317/v1

# De cuoi file, co chu y (xem doan tren ve bo quet bi mat).
CLIPROXY_API_KEY=

# --- Khoa cua cac MCP server ---
#
# Day LA bi mat, va chung phai o day chu khong o `.env`: `{env:...}` trong
# opencode.json duoc giai bang moi truong cua CHINH tien trinh opencode-server,
# ma container do chi doc file nay. Dat nham sang `.env` thi gia tri thanh chuoi
# rong — khong loi, khong canh bao, chi la MCP server tu choi xac thuc.
#
# Chung KHONG BAO GIO duoc viet thang vao opencode.json.template: repo nay PUBLIC.
# Job quet bi mat cua CI se chan, nhung dung dua vao no lam lop bao ve duy nhat.

# exa-mcp-server
EXA_API_KEY=

# @brave/brave-search-mcp-server — dang tat (enabled: false) nhung van khai bien
# de bat len khong phai sua ca hai cho.
BRAVE_API_KEY=

# mcp.tavily.com — khoa nam TRONG chuoi URL cua endpoint, khong phai o header.
TAVILY_API_KEY=
